WEBVTT

00:25:59.730 --> 00:26:02.026
Sure, you want to be authentic.

00:26:02.050 --> 00:26:04.003
But what happens when your authentic self

00:26:04.027 --> 00:26:06.630
runs counter to the culture
of your workplace?

00:26:08.820 --> 00:26:10.616
Carmen, a natural heretic

00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:13.626
in an organization that
cherishes strict hierarchies,

00:26:13.650 --> 00:26:15.196
was about to find out.

00:26:15.220 --> 00:26:16.380
CM: A senior leader,

00:26:16.404 --> 00:26:17.973
a woman came up to me and said,

00:26:17.997 --> 00:26:22.656
"Carmen, you're just going to
have to censor yourself.

00:26:22.680 --> 00:26:25.593
You need to stop saying some
of the things you're saying.

00:26:25.617 --> 00:26:28.408
You have a bright career in front of you,

00:26:28.432 --> 00:26:31.936
and you're going to ruin it
if you keep talking like this."